// Source: Cpp1 declarations with reference types `T&` and `T&&`.
// functions.md: Cpp2 passes by reference through a parameter's passing
// style, and has no reference types; `cpp1_ref<T>` names a Cpp1 reference.
// Upstream rejects these as parse errors.
